== PREMISE
  P0 PASS NO_AUTO_POSSESS (0x4000): `a+(?C)b` on `aaac` callouts with the option 6, without 3 (expect 6 and 3)
  P0 PASS NO_START_OPTIMIZE (0x10000): `(?C)abc` on `xxabd` callouts 6 (expect 6: every start tried)
  P0 PASS MATCH_UNSET_BACKREF (0x200): `(?:(?<a>a)|x)\k<a>b` on `xb` default None, with the option (0, 2, {'a': None}) (expect None, a match)
  P0 PASS callout as a condition, callout TRUE: bare `x(?(?C)(?=)a|b)` matches xa/xb True/False ; inside a lookahead `x(?(?=(?C))a|b)` True/False (expect T/F, T/F)
  P0 PASS callout as a condition, callout FALSE: bare `x(?(?C)(?=)a|b)` matches xa/xb False/False ; inside a lookahead `x(?(?=(?C))a|b)` False/True (expect F/F, F/T)
  P0 PASS ANCHORED|ENDANCHORED (WHOLE): `\d+` whole on `12` True, on `12x` False, on `x12` False
  P1 PASS `(?:(?<g1>\d\d)|(?<g2>\d)\d)(?C)` on `25`, the callout failing when g1 = 25: (0, 2, {'g1': None, 'g2': '2'}) (expect g2 = 2: the second branch)
